            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"native-vacuum-ibp\">Native vacuum IBP</h2></span><section class=\"feynkit-integral-family\" style=\"max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto\"><style>.feynkit-integral-family > .feynkit-family-metadata > div { display:inline; }</style><strong>Integral family</strong><div class=\"feynkit-family-metadata\"><strong>Loop momenta:</strong> <div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">K<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></div><div class=\"feynkit-family-metadata\"><strong>External momenta:</strong> <em>none</em></div><div class=\"feynkit-family-metadata\"><strong>Dimension:</strong> <div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">D</div></div><div>Rank: 1 / 1 &middot; complete &middot; independent</div><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:.4rem\"><caption style=\"text-align:left\">Ordered inverse propagators (1)</caption><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:right\">D<sub>1</sub></th><td style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:left\"><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-M<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>dot<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>K<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>0,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,K<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>0,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></section><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>I(2)</strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>1/2\u00b7D/M-1/M<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></div><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>I(3)</strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>-3/4\u00b7D/M\u00b2+1/8\u00b7D\u00b2/M\u00b2+1/M\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></div><marimo-ui-element object-id='PKri-0' random-id='03410cbc-2422-226b-af7d-a16450e30a2b'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;exact_trace_rows&#92;&quot;:0,&#92;&quot;rows&#92;&quot;:6,&#92;&quot;sectors&#92;&quot;:1,&#92;&quot;seeds&#92;&quot;:6}]&quot;' data-total-rows='1' data-total-columns='4' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-show-filters='false' data-show-download='true' data-show-search='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data-show-page-size-selector='false' data-show-column-explorer='true' data-show-chart-builder='true' data-row-headers='[]' data-hidden-columns='[]' data-has-stable-row-id='false' data-lazy='false' data-preload='false'></marimo-table></marimo-ui-element><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Both powers reduce to I(1). The calculation checks tha