    {
      "id": "Xref",
      "code_hash": "d7a003f672aa9d83349756eaf6fd2d64",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"a-coupling-counterterm-from-the-ghost-vertex\">A coupling counterterm from the ghost vertex</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Write <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(Z=1+a_4\\delta Z||)</marimo-tex>. The generated self-energy determines\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\delta Z_c=C_A(3-\\xi)/(4\\epsilon)||)</marimo-tex>.\nThe ghost\u2013gluon counterterm is\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\delta Z_c+\\delta Z_g+\\delta Z_A/2||)</marimo-tex> times its tree tensor.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Here the gluon field counterterm\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\delta Z_A=[C_A(13-3\\xi)-4N_f]/(6\\epsilon)||)</marimo-tex> is supplied from the\nseparate QCD renormalization example. Combining it with the calculated\nghost and vertex poles gives\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\delta Z_g=-(11C_A-2N_f)/(6\\epsilon)||)</marimo-tex>, independently of <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\xi||)</marimo-tex>.\nNo counterterm diagrams are generated here.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">In Landau gauge (<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\xi=0||)</marimo-tex>), the vertex pole vanishes. Vary the gauge to\ncheck its cancellation against the three counterterms.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
